<Layout title="Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md & Richmond Va. | ATECT Architecture" description="Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md & Richmond Va. — comprehensive construction documents, interior fit-out design, ADA compliance, project management and permitting services by ATECT Architecture.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Commercial Projects</div>
    <h1>Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md &amp; Richmond Va.</h1>
    <p>Comprehensive construction documents and interior fit-out services for two Mariner Finance locations.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section project-intro">
    <div class="project-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Mariner Finance</div>
      <h2>Interior Fit-Out &amp; Construction Documents</h2>
      <p>We delivered a comprehensive array of construction documents for the interior fit-out of two distinct locations, situated in Waldorf, Maryland, and Richmond, Virginia. Our team ensured that both spaces adhered strictly to current building regulations as well as the latest ADA (Americans with Disabilities Act) requirements.</p>
      <p>The design process focused on creating functional and aesthetically pleasing office environments, thoughtfully incorporating a breakroom to promote employee relaxation and collaboration. We also introduced a new ADA-compliant bathroom that features a dedicated mop sink area, ensuring cleanliness and sanitation. Additionally, we included the installation of a new Hi-lo drinking fountain, making hydration accessible to all.</p>
      <p>To facilitate a smooth process, we provided detailed project management services and expedited the permitting process for our client, ensuring compliance and efficiency every step of the way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="scope-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Scope of Work</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Complete interior fit-out construction documents</li>
        <li>Waldorf, Maryland and Richmond, Virginia locations</li>
        <li>Building-code and ADA compliance</li>
        <li>Functional office and breakroom planning</li>
        <li>ADA-compliant bathroom with mop sink area</li>
        <li>New Hi-lo drinking fountain</li>
        <li>Project management and coordination</li>
        <li>Expedited permitting support</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">Project Gallery</div>
      <h2>Mariner Finance</h2>
      <p>Browse the commercial project imagery and construction-document materials from the original ATECT Architecture portfolio.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="slider" data-slider tabindex="0" aria-label="Mariner Finance project slideshow">
      <div class="slides">
        {images.map((image, index) => (
          <img class:list={{ active: index === 0 }} data-slide={index} src={image.src} alt={`${image.alt} — image ${index + 1}`} loading={index === 0 ? "eager" : "lazy"} />
        ))}
      </div>
      <button class="arrow prev" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous project image">&#10094;</button>
      <button class="arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next project image">&#10095;</button>
      <div class="counter" aria-live="polite"><span data-current>1</span> / {images.length}</div>
      <button class="fullscreen" type="button" data-fullscreen>View Fullscreen</button>
    </div>

    <div class="thumbs" aria-label="Slideshow thumbnails">
      {images.map((image, index) => (
        <button class:list={{ active: index === 0 }} type="button" data-thumb={index} aria-label={`View image ${index + 1}`}>
          <img src={image.src} alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  
<section class="explore-projects"><div class="eyebrow">Explore More Projects</div><h2>See More of Our Work</h2><p>Explore residential design, custom home planning and architectural visualization by ATECT Architecture.</p><div class="explore-grid"><a href="/projects/residential"><span>Residential Projects</span><strong>View Residential Work →</strong></a><a href="/projects/custom-homes"><span>Custom Home Plans</span><strong>Explore Custom Homes →</strong></a><a href="/3d-renderings"><span>3-D Renderings</span><strong>View Renderings →</strong></a><a class="explore-all" href="/projects"><span>Portfolio</span><strong>View All Projects →</strong></a></div></section>
<section class="section alt project-cta">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Commercial Design Services</div>
      <h2>Need construction documents for your next project?</h2>
      <p>Let's discuss your commercial space, fit-out, permitting and documentation needs.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Contact ATECT Architecture</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-slider]').forEach((slider) => {
    const slides = Array.from(slider.querySelectorAll('.slides img'));
    const thumbs = Array.from(slider.parentElement?.querySelectorAll('[data-thumb]') || []);
    const current = slider.querySelector('[data-current]');
    const prev = slider.querySelector('[data-prev]');
    const next = slider.querySelector('[data-next]');
    const fullscreen = slider.querySelector('[data-fullscreen]');
    let index = 0;
    let touchStart = 0;

    const show = (nextIndex) => {
      index = (nextIndex + slides.length) % slides.length;
      slides.forEach((slide, i) => slide.classList.toggle('active', i === index));
      thumbs.forEach((thumb, i) => thumb.classList.toggle('active', i === index));
      if (current) current.textContent = String(index + 1);
    };

    prev?.addEventListener('click', () => show(index - 1));
    next?.addEventListener('click', () => show(index + 1));
    thumbs.forEach((thumb, i) => thumb.addEventListener('click', () => show(i)));

    slider.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') show(index - 1);
      if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') show(index + 1);
    });

    slider.addEventListener('touchstart', (event) => {
      touchStart = event.changedTouches[0]?.clientX || 0;
    }, { passive: true });

    slider.addEventListener('touchend', (event) => {
      const touchEnd = event.changedTouches[0]?.clientX || 0;
      const distance = touchEnd - touchStart;
      if (Math.abs(distance) > 45) show(index + (distance < 0 ? 1 : -1));
    }, { passive: true });

    fullscreen?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
        await slider.requestFullscreen?.();
      } else {
        await document.exitFullscreen?.();
      }
    });

    show(0);
  });
</script>

<style is:global>
  .project-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(280px,.75fr);gap:clamp(40px,7vw,100px);align-items:start}
  .project-copy h2,.section-heading h2,.project-cta h2{font:600 clamp(34px,4.5vw,58px)/1.05 Manrope;margin:0 0 24px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .project-copy p{color:#555;line-height:1.8;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px}
  .scope-card{background:#f3f1ec;padding:34px;border-top:4px solid #111}
  .scope-card ul{margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .scope-card li{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,.14);line-height:1.5;color:#333}
  .scope-card li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .gallery-section{padding-top:20px}
  .section-heading{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:42px}
  .section-heading p{color:#666;line-height:1.7;font-size:17px}
  .slider{position:relative;background:#111;aspect-ratio:16/10;min-height:520px;overflow:hidden;outline:none}
  .slides{position:absolute;inset:0}
  .slides img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s ease;pointer-events:none}
  .slides img.active{opacity:1}
  .arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:52px;height:52px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(17,17,17,.72);color:#fff;font-size:25px;cursor:pointer;z-index:2}
  .arrow:hover{background:#fff;color:#111}
  .prev{left:22px}.next{right:22px}
  .counter{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:rgba(17,17,17,.78);color:#fff;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;z-index:2}
  .fullscreen{position:absolute;right:22px;bottom:20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);background:rgba(17,17,17,.75);color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;cursor:pointer;z-index:2}
  .thumbs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;padding:0 4px}
  .thumbs button{flex:0 0 88px;width:88px;height:66px;padding:0;border:2px solid transparent;background:#eee;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer}
  .thumbs button.active{border-color:#111}
  .thumbs img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  .project-cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px}
  .project-cta h2{margin-bottom:14px}
  .project-cta p{color:#555;line-height:1.7;max-width:650px;margin:0}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .project-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .slider{min-height:420px;aspect-ratio:4/3}
    .thumbs{gap:8px}
    .thumbs button{flex-basis:76px;width:76px;height:57px}
    .project-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  }
  @media(max-width:600px){
    .slider{min-height:300px}
    .arrow{width:44px;height:44px;font-size:20px}.prev{left:10px}.next{right:10px}
    .fullscreen{right:10px;bottom:12px;font-size:12px;padding:7px 9px}
    .counter{bottom:13px;font-size:12px}
    .thumbs{gap:6px}
    .thumbs button{flex-basis:64px;width:64px;height:48px}
    .scope-card{padding:26px}
  }
.explore-projects{padding:82px clamp(24px,7vw,100px);background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center}.explore-projects h2{font:600 clamp(34px,4.5vw,56px)/1.05 Manrope;margin:8px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.explore-projects>p{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 34px;color:#666;line-height:1.7}.explore-grid{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;text-align:left}.explore-grid a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;min-height:125px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}.explore-grid a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#111}.explore-grid span{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#777}.explore-grid strong{font-size:17px;line-height:1.35}.explore-grid .explore-all{background:#111820;color:#fff;border-color:#111820}.explore-grid .explore-all span{color:#d9dde0}@media(max-width:900px){.explore-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:560px){.explore-projects{padding:64px 20px}.explore-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.explore-grid a{min-height:105px}}

</style>
